eo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/5f5fbbf28ff4fe424999a66fa212b7c4.poster.avif?t=1738292903\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/5f5fbbf28ff4fe424999a66fa212b7c4.webm?t=1738292903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/5f5fbbf28ff4fe424999a66fa212b7c4.mp4?t=1738292903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2>There are various characters from all walks of life representing the different experiences during the pandemic, ranging from an office worker, an athlete, a nurse, a conspirator\u2026<br>We hope that you will get some closure when you meet a character you can empathize with.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/d4813d08db41265afc03aacc922ed1dc.poster.avif?t=1738292903\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/d4813d08db41265afc03aacc922ed1dc.webm?t=1738292903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885880/extras/d4813d08db41265afc03aacc922ed1dc.mp4?t=1738292903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
